1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,650
Your contact form could be losing
customers before they ever contact you.

2
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:06,400
Too many required fields,
a weak submit button,

3
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:09,000
and no clue what happens next
all add friction.

4
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:13,500
Start with the essentials: who they are,
how to reach them,

5
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:19,600
and what service they need.
Then tell them when you will respond.

6
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:24,400
More traffic will not fix a broken
contact process. Find the leaks first.
